{"id":"planeta","lemma":"planeta","pos":"noun","rank":784,"glosses":["planet"],"ipa":"/plaˈneta/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"planetas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/38/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-planeta.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Podemos salvar el planeta?","en":"Can we save the planet?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/80021"},{"text":"Me pregunto si existe vida en otros planetas.","en":"I wonder if life exists on other planets.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/610740"},{"text":"Habitamos el mismo planeta.","en":"We live on the same planet.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/353262"},{"text":"¿Cuántos planetas orbitan el sol?","en":"How many planets orbit the sun?"},{"text":"La Tierra es un bello planeta.","en":"Earth is a beautiful planet.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706973"}]}